╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│▸ Use any Linux distribution inside your terminal     │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Commands:                                           │
│  stop                 Stop running containers        │
│  create               Create new containers          │
│  upgrade              Upgrade packages in containers │
│  assemble             Build containers from a spec   │
│                                                      │
│  ls  ┆ list           List all containers            │
│  rm  ┆ remove         Remove containers              │
│  run ┆ enter          Enter running containers       │
│  eph ┆ ephemeral      Spin up disposable containers  │
│  cmp ┆ compatibility  compatible image & system test │
│  gde ┆ generate-entry Generate .desktop entry        │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│▸ Extras:                                             │
│  --help    | -h Show this help message               │
│  --version | -v Print version information            │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯